  "application": {
    "cn": "该系列是一种外形小、高性能的执行机构，分为双动作和单动作两种，与角行程调节阀组合，可用于调节和开关的场合。该系列也可用于其它回转装置的场合。",
    "en": "This Series provides double-acting and spring return pneumatic torque cylinder actuators characterized by small size and high-performance. Combined with rotary stem motion type control valves, the actuators of this Series are suited for modulating and on-off services. Uses with other rotary motion devices are also good.",
    "features": [
      {
        "cn": "一体式通用紧凑设计：同型号的双作用和弹簧复位执行机构，具有相同的缸体和端盖，可通过增加或者拆除弹簧来进行现场转换，减少产品备件型号，极大地方便了用户的现场应用。",
        "en": "One universal and compact design: the same type of double acting and spring return actuators, with the same cylinder and end cover, can scene conversion by increasing or removing the spring. It reduces spare parts model, which greatly facilitates the application users."
      },
      {
        "cn": "采用双活塞齿轮齿条的结构设计：具有结构紧凑、使用寿命长、动作迅速等优点。安装位置对称设计，可通过简单的活塞对调方式来简易的改变转向。",
        "en": "The structure design of dual piston rack and pinion: has the advantages of compact structure, the use of the advantages of long service life, quick action. The design of symmetric mounting position, can be simple to change through simple piston on the way."
      },
      {
        "cn": "齿条和活塞上的复合轴承以及导向环：可确保操作精确、低摩擦及长寿命，并可有效防止输出轴撕裂。",
        "en": "Rack and piston on the composite bearing and the guide ring: can ensure accurate operation, with low friction and long life, and also can effectively prevent the output shaft tear."
      },
      {
        "cn": "外部的两个独立行程调节螺钉：能够方便而精确地在两个方向上进行±4°的调节。从而使执行机构在全开和全关的位置与阀门位置保持一致。",
        "en": "Two independent travel outside of the adjusting screw: can convenient and accurate to plus or minus 4 degree adjustment in two direction. So that the actuator is consistent with the valve position in the fully open and fully closed position."
      }
    ],
    "pdf_page": 3
  },
